Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790096399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790035199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Bars 90-116 are a 27-bar two-sided range with dense overlap; the whole window can be read as large trading ranges (base 1512.91-1974.46, then 2357.18-2680) with bar 87-89 as one oversized leg rather than a sustained trend.", "Bar 120 does not close at its high (74.39 upper tail) and clears the prior high 2771 by only 4.61, a margin well inside the 100+ point bars seen in this window.", "The three prior pushes above 2600 all failed with closes back near mid-range (bar 110 H2680/C2514.72, bar 113 H2609.02/C2514.07, bar 118 H2700/C2632.98), showing sellers above 2600.", "Bar 89's 255.70 upper tail right after bar 87's vertical rise is consistent with a buy climax; a climax followed by 27 bars of overlap often ends the trend leg instead of continuing it.", "No bar before the final one closed above 2700, so acceptance above the range top is not yet demonstrated."], "evidence_for": ["Progression of higher lows since the window low: 1368.42 (bar 13), 1512.91 (bar 33), 1821.49 (bar 71), 2357.18 (bar 101); highs also rise (1974.46 bar 64, 2771 bar 89, 2850 bar 120).", "Bar 87's spike (335.65 body, close 41.64 below its high) breaks out of the 73-bar base with the strongest momentum bar in the window, and bars 88-89 extend it to 2771.", "The 27-bar consolidation never retraces into the pre-spike area: its low 2357.18 (bar 101) is 451.55 above bar 87's low 1905.63, so higher prices are being held.", "Bars 117-120 are four consecutive up-closing bars, and the last close 2775.61 sits above the range high 2700 and above the prior spike high 2771, which is an upside breakout attempt rather than a test of the range low.", "Bar 120 closes in the upper 64% of its 208.3 range, so the latest Always-In direction is long on the current bars."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window covers 120 closed D1 bars from 1779667200000 to 1790035199999; window low 1368.42 (bar 13), window high 2850 (bar 120).", "Bars 1-13 sell off from 2139.34 (bar 1 high) to 1368.42 (bar 13 low), -36.0%; bar 13 (O1581.32 H1599.27 L1368.42 C1568.55) closes with a 200.13-point lower tail, and bar 14 (O1568.55 H1690.78 L1563.52 C1687.83) is a large bull bar closing near its high.", "Bars 14-86 build a 73-bar base between 1512.91 (bar 33 low) and 1974.46 (bar 64 high) with dense bar overlap and rising lows in the second half (1694.74 bar 40, 1821.49 bar 71, 1868.42 bar 78, 1875.03 bar 83).", "Bar 87 (O1916.51 H2293.8 L1905.63 C2252.16) is a bull spike bar with a 335.65 body, about +17.5% from its open, closing 41.64 below its high; bar 88 closes 2326.32; bar 89 spikes to 2771 and closes 2515.30 with a 255.70 upper tail.", "Bars 90-116 form a 27-bar range between 2357.18 (bar 101 low) and 2680 (bar 110 high); most bars trade 2386-2557 with repeated upside probes closing back inside: bar 110 H2680/C2514.72, bar 113 H2609.02/C2514.07, bar 118 H2700/C2632.98.", "Bars 117-120 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61, each above the prior close, starting from bar 117's 2446.22 open.", "Bar 120 (O2642.9 H2850 L2641.7 C2775.61) has a 208.3 range, a 132.71 bull body, closes at 64% of its range with a 74.39 upper tail; the close 2775.61 is 75.61 above the post-spike range high 2700 and 4.61 above the window's prior high 2771.", "Ordered read: bear selloff, long base, bull spike out of that base, 27-bar consolidation holding above the spike low, then a four-bar push to new window highs."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear selloff from the window high 2139.34 (bar 1) to 1368.42 (bar 13 low): 13 bars of mostly lower closes with ranges expanding to 230.85 on bar 13, whose 200.13 lower tail shows sellers giving up the low; immediately reversed by the large bull bar 14.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779667200000, "upper_boundary": "2139.34"}, {"description": "Long base/consolidation after the selloff, 1512.91 (bar 33 low) to 1974.46 (bar 64 high). Bars 14-38 chop roughly 1550-1845; bars 39-86 drift up with higher lows and repeated tests of 1900-1975; heavy overlap throughout, typical range behavior.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Three-bar bull spike out of the base. Bar 87 (O1916.51 H2293.8 L1905.63 C2252.16) is a 335.65-body bull trend bar closing 41.64 below its high; bar 88 closes 2326.32; bar 89 spikes to 2771 and closes 2515.30, leaving a 255.70 upper tail.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "27-bar two-sided range following the spike, 2357.18 (bar 101 low) to 2680 (bar 110 high). Dense overlap; the bulk of bars trade 2386-2557 and each upside probe closes back inside (bar 110 H2680/C2514.72, bar 113 H2609.02/C2514.07, bar 118 H2700/C2632.98).", "end_time_ms": 1789603199999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Current four-bar up leg and upside breakout attempt above the 27-bar range: closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61 from bar 117's 2446.22 open. Bar 120 (O2642.9 H2850 L2641.7 C2775.61) closes above the range high 2700 and 4.61 above the window's prior high 2771, but 74.39 below its own high, so acceptance is not yet shown.", "end_time_ms": 1790035199999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850, or a second consecutive close above 2771 with the bar closing in its upper third, would confirm acceptance above the range and support trend continuation.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2700, and especially below 2680 (bar 110 high), re-entering the 2357.18-2680 range, would mark bar 120's push as a failed breakout, particularly if the bar closes near its low.", "Range continuation: continued overlap with highs capped near 2771-2850 and no new closing high would keep the phase as range and shift the regime read toward trading-range.", "Trend damage: a close below 2436.87 (bar 117 low) negates the four-bar leg; a close below 2357.18 (bar 101 low) ends the post-spike higher-low sequence and turns the read to transition-unclear or trading-range.", "Deep failure: acceptance below 2111 (bar 88 low) would invalidate the spike structure and return the pre-spike base to relevance."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790092799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Bar 112 expanded to 2850.00 but closed 2723.15, surrendering 126.85 points of its own range; no subsequent bar closed above 2804.59, which is the classic no-follow-through signature of a possible buy climax.", "Bars 116-119 are four overlapping small-range bars (48.96, 25.19, 29.85, 39.00 points) whose highs 2776.18, 2741.20, 2752.61, 2761.62 are all below bar 115's 2804.59, so the most recent immediate sequence is a descending series of highs inside a two-sided pullback.", "This window already shows that upside breakouts can fail here: bar 53 reached 2680.00 and closed 2555.52, bar 73 reached 2609.02 and closed 2514.07, and bars 77-78 broke the range low to 2358.62; range behaviour has repeatedly reasserted after expansion."], "evidence_for": ["Successive higher swing highs since bar 79: 2636.28/2643.52 (bars 95-96), 2700.00 (bars 100 and 110) and 2850.00 (bar 112), with successive higher swing lows: 2384.29/2370.54 (bars 82-84), 2568.16 (bar 106), 2716.01 (bar 117).", "Trend bars close near their highs on the advance: bar 95 closes 2578.60 against a 2585.50 high and bar 96 closes 2636.28 against a 2643.52 high; the breakout above the 2545.29 range top held.", "Latest close 2742.31 is above every close in the first 94 bars of the window (highest pre-breakout close was 2555.52 at bar 53), so the entire prior range has been left behind."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens at 2389.52 (bar 0) and closes at 2742.31 (bar 119), a net change of about +14.8% across 120 closed H4 bars.", "Bars 0-4 rotate inside 2373.00-2417.19; bar 5 then expands 2404.35-2509.15 and closes 2506.79 near its high.", "Bar 11 opens 2523.22 and closes 2450.96 with a low of 2436.73, a ~90-point bear bar that begins a long overlap phase.", "Bars 12-94 mostly stay between 2358.62 (bar 78 low) and 2545.29 (bar 55 high); bar 53 (high 2680.00, close 2555.52) and bar 73 (high 2609.02, close 2514.07) both close far below their highs.", "Bars 77-78 close 2423.29 and 2412.95 with lows 2390.73 and 2358.62; bars 79-80 stabilise at 2397.10/2400.78 and bars 79-94 recover to close 2507.31.", "Bars 95-96 are wide bull bars: open 2507.15 close 2578.60 (high 2585.50) and open 2579.97 close 2636.28 (high 2643.52), both closing near their highs.", "Bars 97-107 overlap between 2568.16 (bar 106 low) and 2700.00 (bar 100 high) before bars 108-115 advance to 2804.59 (bar 115 high, close 2775.61).", "Bar 112 spans 2658.06-2850.00 and closes 2723.15, leaving a 126.85-point upper tail; bars 113-119 then trade inside 2716.01-2804.59 with highs 2795.00, 2770.03, 2804.59, 2776.18, 2741.20, 2752.61, 2761.62.", "Bars 116-119 have ranges of 48.96, 25.19, 29.85 and 39.00 points and close 2738.87, 2724.95, 2740.20, 2742.31, all holding above 2716.01."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Long two-sided phase from bar 11 to bar 94 with repeated failed breakout attempts above the 2530-2545 area (bar 53 spiked to 2680.00 but closed 2555.52; bar 73 spiked to 2609.02 but closed 2514.07) and one failed break below (bars 77-78 to 2358.62) that was quickly reclaimed. Lower envelope includes the bar 78 undercut; the core of the range held mostly above 2411.04.", "end_time_ms": 1789718400000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1788523200000, "upper_boundary": "2545.29"}, {"description": "Bull breakout above the multi-week range top: bars 95-96 expand upward (2507.15 to 2578.60, then 2579.97 to 2636.28) and no close after bar 94 returned below the 2537.57-2545.29 area, so the break was accepted rather than reversed.", "end_time_ms": 1789747200000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1789732800000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Bar 112 is the widest bull bar of the window (range 2658.06-2850.00) but closes at 2723.15, giving back 126.85 points of the range; the high of 2850.00 was never tested again (later highs 2795.00, 2804.59) and the bar produced no immediate upside follow-through, so it reads as a climactic expansion rather than a clean continuation bar.", "end_time_ms": 1790049599999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Current tight overlap after the last bull leg: bars 113-119 hold inside 2804.59 (bar 115 high) and 2716.01 (bar 117 low), with four consecutive small overlapping bars (116-119) closing 2738.87, 2724.95, 2740.20, 2742.31 and making lower highs versus bar 115.", "end_time_ms": 1790092799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2716.01", "start_time_ms": 1790049600000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2804.59 (bar 115 high) with a wide-range bull bar closing near its high, or acceptance above 2850.00, would confirm the current small range as a pullback and move the phase toward breakout-spike.", "Bear resolution: a lower high below 2804.59 followed by a close below 2716.01 (bar 117 low) would make the 113-119 cluster a possible final flag and argue for a phase shift to range or transition with always-in at least neutral.", "Range resolution: another roughly 8-10 bars trading inside 2716.01-2804.59 without a close outside would reclassify the current structure as a trading range (phase range) rather than a bull-channel pullback.", "Structural damage: a close back below the 2643.52-2658.06 zone (bar 96 high / bar 112 low) would break the sequence of higher lows from bar 106 and shift the primary regime read toward trading-range or transition-unclear."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2461.91", "close_time_ms": 1789667999999, "high": "2473.98", "low": "2459.55", "open": "2467.64", "open_time_ms": 1789664400000, "volume": "1826168.078"}, {"close": "2451.55", "close_time_ms": 1789671599999, "high": "2462.34", "low": "2451.18", "open": "2461.91", "open_time_ms": 1789668000000, "volume": "1502725.734"}, {"close": "2448.74", "close_time_ms": 1789675199999, "high": "2454.03", "low": "2444.32", "open": "2451.55", "open_time_ms": 1789671600000, "volume": "1739963.044"}, {"close": "2451.99", "close_time_ms": 1789678799999, "high": "2457.42", "low": "2446.22", "open": "2448.74", "open_time_ms": 1789675200000, "volume": "1658669.559"}, {"close": "2447.45", "close_time_ms": 1789682399999, "high": "2454.68", "low": "2447.45", "open": "2451.99", "open_time_ms": 1789678800000, "volume": "1083818.438"}, {"close": "2443.75", "close_time_ms": 1789685999999, "high": "2447.45", "low": "2438.33", "open": "2447.45", "open_time_ms": 1789682400000, "volume": "1988637.215"}, {"close": "2446.22", "close_time_ms": 1789689599999, "high": "2449.2", "l